WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.230
- So you guys just celebrated

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.430
it's your one year anniversary?

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:03.263
- We did.

00:00:03.263 --> 00:00:04.096
- Congratulations.

00:00:04.096 --> 00:00:05.100
- Thank you.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.300
- That's so cool.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.940
- I didn't think, I did not
ever think I'd get married.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.530
I didn't think I was
gonna be a marriage person

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.050
but I'm enjoying it tremendously.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.070
- That's awesome.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.360
I never thought I'd get married.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.835
It didn't work for me.

00:00:16.835 --> 00:00:18.480
But I never thought
I'd get married though.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.313
I didn't.

00:00:19.313 --> 00:00:20.190
And it can be wonderful.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:22.200
- What I would love about
about you and this show

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.780
is how open you are because
so many people we know we live

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.630
in a world where people want
to be glossy and perfect.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:28.500
- [Kelly] I am unfiltered.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.120
- The fact that you come out
here and you're just like,

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.540
yeah, marriage, not it.

00:00:32.515 --> 00:00:34.770
- Not for everyone, yeah.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.900
- I think I had to obviously

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.910
find someone very
specific who would be down

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:41.220
to do marriage the way
that I want to do marriage.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.570
- Absolutely, yeah, I'm not against it.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:43.650
I think it's a beautiful thing

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:44.850
and I think it's so wonderful too.

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:48.990
Like even we have a couple
on today later in the show

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:50.100
and they're like older

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.193
and they just got married
and they're like 80s

00:00:52.193 --> 00:00:54.120
and 90s and I'm just
like that's beautiful.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.530
I think it's beautiful.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.910
But I do think we all

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:58.590
because of how we grew up,

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:01.020
we all our love languages are differently.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.739
You have to find someone that kind

00:01:02.739 --> 00:01:04.200
of matches you and you grow together.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.336
I think that's important.

00:01:05.336 --> 00:01:06.169
- And think it's beautiful
if you're getting to do it.

00:01:06.169 --> 00:01:07.470
If you're doing it in your 80s and 90s

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:08.850
you're doing it on your own terms.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:09.810
And I think so many

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:13.800
of us were sold a specific
bill of goods about what sort

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.770
of a heterosexual partnership
was supposed to look like.

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:20.070
And I think one of the benefits of having

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:21.900
had little experience under my belt

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.367
before I got married was I was like

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:26.580
I was up for living a very different kind

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.470
of life where I was doing it on my own.

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:31.200
And then he just happened
to make that life better.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:32.033
- Oh, that's so cool.

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:33.510
You found something that compliments you.

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.343
That's amazing.

00:01:34.343 --> 00:01:35.610
- And I hope I compliment him.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:36.472
I keep talking about how he
has to follow all my rules

00:01:36.472 --> 00:01:38.850
and how he compliments me.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:39.683
- We know you're kidding, we know.

00:01:39.683 --> 00:01:41.349
- Okay, thank you.
- We know you're being funny.

00:01:41.349 --> 00:01:42.182
- Thank you.

